{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The very domination! Be the demon king who conquers the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;MURAYAKI VILLAIN&quot;a village-burning, female-oriented, \u2640 &gt; \u2642 Demon King Army raising dating sim<br>\u25c6 Play time: 1-2 hours / endings: 12 \u25c6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/ebc8a31424faded18e29821a4902213f.avif?t=1763264315\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the Demon King who is stronger than anyone else, stand on the front line, and take this world in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a handsome \u2640 &gt; \u2642 full-fledged villain game for those of you who want to be a dark hero of destruction rather than a protected princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/8f0b7053759e4548e7e3becee8152cd6.webp?t=1763264315\" width=300 height=55 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/0e140e176dad07603b24ddeea78ad598.poster.avif?t=1763264315\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/0e140e176dad07603b24ddeea78ad598.webm?t=1763264315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/0e140e176dad07603b24ddeea78ad598.mp4?t=1763264315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to expand the demon's territory by burning human villages and conquer the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, who has lost his demon castle and all his weapons to the humans, uses ...... the &quot;frying pan&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With his assistants in tow, he sometimes clouds and draws out negative forces to put wood on the fires of hell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/f6dcdf3803f707c6d4615a1e7d3e434a.webp?t=1763264315\" width=300 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/dad74b3472edc5fae8fe4b296c4c1b18.avif?t=1763264315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras_big/dad74b3472edc5fae8fe4b296c4c1b18.avif?t=1763264315 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero is the sole survivor of the thousands of descendants of the Demon King. Of course, the Demon King's army was destroyed by the heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero must put to work four &quot;useless&quot; demons that have survived without fighting because they were left behind, and grow the Demon King's army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/9214d0e20dda64891a2b8f26db526bc9.webp?t=1763264315\" width=300 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/665dd2d961eaf50b35d2d61e65f32576.avif?t=1763264315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras_big/665dd2d961eaf50b35d2d61e65f32576.avif?t=1763264315 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karma, which accumulates when you do bad things, is the source of the demon king's magical power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Karma, you can do anything you want. ......!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/575fbfb0185624dc85cbca34c27b460b.webp?t=1763264315\" width=300 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/3c50432811f516e2284a6fe1d4b2966c.avif?t=1763264315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras_big/3c50432811f516e2284a6fe1d4b2966c.avif?t=1763264315 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a demon king, interacting with your subordinates is an important part of your job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go out for a drink or have a conversation with them to increase their loyalty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/79375bbac032c01e5dd32ee2ee195721.avif?t=1763264315\" width=620 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an raising dating sim for those who want to be a bad and strong woman and train a female-attacking demon king army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, put it on your wish list now and take the first step toward world domination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2529780?t=1763264315","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2529