ived without fighting because they were left behind, and grow the Demon King's army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/9214d0e20dda64891a2b8f26db526bc9.webp?t=1763264315\" width=300 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/665dd2d961eaf50b35d2d61e65f32576.avif?t=1763264315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras_big/665dd2d961eaf50b35d2d61e65f32576.avif?t=1763264315 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karma, which accumulates when you do bad things, is the source of the demon king's magical power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Karma, you can do anything you want. ......!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/575fbfb0185624dc85cbca34c27b460b.webp?t=1763264315\" width=300 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/3c50432811f516e2284a6fe1d4b2966c.avif?t=1763264315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras_big/3c50432811f516e2284a6fe1d4b2966c.avif?t=1763264315 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a demon king, interacting with your subordinates is an important part of your job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go out for a drink or have a conversation with them to increase their loyalty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap